@UrlShortener.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5210

### Create (201) or reuse (200) a short URL
POST {{UrlShortener.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://example.com/docs?page=1",
  "expiresAtUtc": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### Validation failure (400)
POST {{UrlShortener.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "javascript:alert(1)"
}

### Redirect (302 with Location) for an active code; replace with a code returned above
GET {{UrlShortener.Api_HostAddress}}/Abc1234

### Unknown, inactive, expired or malformed code (404)
GET {{UrlShortener.Api_HostAddress}}/not-a-code

### Click analytics (200) for an existing code, including inactive or expired ones
GET {{UrlShortener.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/analytics/Abc1234

### Malformed or unknown code (404)
GET {{UrlShortener.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/analytics/not-a-code
